{
  "entry": "At dusk in the rain I waited with my sister at the train station. At the ticket kiosk she folded her last ticket into my coat pocket and asked me to keep it until she came home. The street clock kept ticking after the lights went out. I pressed the damp paper flat when I got home, and the apartment felt too quiet.",
